      "claim_id": "s0c0",
      "section": "研究背景",
      "text": "Transformer 是仅基于注意力机制、完全摒弃循环和卷积的新网络架构；在两项机器翻译任务上，这些模型质量更优、更可并行，且训练所需时间显著更少。",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "evr_dc8ac288398b8a3f0791",
        "evr_57c28e24fe0d7ff95d3b"
      ],
      "status": "source_checked",
      "kind": "paper_fact",
      "quotes": [
        {
          "evidence_id": "evr_dc8ac288398b8a3f0791",
          "quote": "based solely on attention mechanisms, dispensing with recurrence and convolutions\nentirely. Experiments on two machine translation tasks show these models to\nbe superior in quality while being more parallelizable and requiring signiﬁcantly\nless time to train",
          "match": "exact",
          "start": 301,
          "end": 559
        },
        {
          "evidence_id": "evr_57c28e24fe0d7ff95d3b",
          "quote": "relying entirely on an attention mechanism to draw global dependencies between input and output",
          "match": "exact",
